OL,3,GNEWSADistricts prepare legal challenge
OL,4,Ato city expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FDistrict councils in Leicestershire
OL,7,Fhave started the process of a potential
OL,8,Flegal challenge to plans to expand
OL,9,FLeicester.
OL,11,FGovernment plans to create an enlarged
OL,12,Funitary authority are currently paused
OL,13,Fbut, on Monday, five district councils
OL,14,Fsent a pre-action letter to ministers
OL,15,Furging them to scrap the process
OL,16,Fentirely.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
