OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1790141193
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSADistricts prepare legal challenge
OL,4,Ato city expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe district councils, which would be
OL,7,Fabolished if reform goes ahead, are
OL,8,Fquestioning whether the government has
OL,9,Ffollowed the correct legal process and
OL,10,Fwhether its proposed outcome is the
OL,11,Fbest for the future of the county.
OL,13,FThe Ministry of Housing, Communities
OL,14,Fand Local Government (MHCLG) said it
OL,15,Fwas not appropriate to comment on legal
OL,16,Fproceedings.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
